## Quick reference

```
Receiving money  →  No PIN needed. Ever.
Entering PIN to receive = you are actually sending.

OTP shared = someone else has access to your account.

Cashback/refund claim? Verify it yourself in the actual app.

Something feels wrong? Stop. Don't continue. Think first.

Got scammed? → Call 1930 | cybercrime.gov.in | Your bank
```

